4,POPULAR TIBETAN SONGS - YouTube Music,https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLm3QXg2coBm3RaTCBPUE0PCV0_X69C8vO,"Listen to POPULAR TIBETAN SONGS on YouTube Music - a dedicated music app with official songs, music videos, remixes, covers, and more.",Dura,Sino-Tibetan
5,Dura language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/dura_language,"The Dura language is an extinct Sino-Tibetan language formerly spoken by the Dura ethnic community in the Lamjung district of central Nepal. [1] Classified within the Trans-Himalayan (also known as Tibeto-Burman) branch of the Sino-Tibetan family, it features complex verbal morphology and a phonological system with aspirated stops and retroflex consonants, distinguishing it from neighboring ...",Dura,Sino-Tibetan
6,Tibetan Music & Audio — Stream & Download Traditional Music ...,https://www.tibetanlibrary.com/collections/audio,"Listen to and download free Tibetan music, sacred chants, mantras, dharma teachings, folk songs, and oral histories. Stream rare recordings of traditional Tibetan instruments, monastic chanting, and contemporary Tibetan artists.",Dura,Sino-Tibetan
